Source tapes/theme.tape
Output work/take-a.mp4
Set Framerate 24
Hide
Type "source tapes/demo-env.zsh && clear" Enter
Sleep 1s
Show
Sleep 800ms
Type "ls"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "cat .mcp.json"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "npx skills add Anuragt1104/mermail-email-e2e -a claude-code -y --copy"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 22s
